  "2026-08-18T21:49:08.769Z","harness:codex","Hosted CI evidence: PR #1061 exact head b953e36c22804ba26974a2c81307e91f1094f3ca passed the broad matrix except Gates (static), which correctly failed at generate-error-code-catalog.mjs --check because the recovery additions changed the reachable catalog. Treating this as gate-positive drift detection and regenerating through the repository-owned command."
  "2026-08-18T21:53:59.056Z","harness:codex","Hosted-gate correction evidence: pnpm contracts:errors:update synchronized both generated catalog partitions with 16 newly reachable recovery/lexicon/parity codes; pnpm contracts:errors:check passed; pnpm quality:static passed end to end, including 3043 lexicon entries, 2904/2904 observed flag parity, recovery closure 4/4 at 1.0, SDK snapshot/import-cost/transport checks, graph composition, and record integrity. The exhaustive-corpus remainder is unchanged, so returning this item to open and releasing ownership."
  "2026-08-18T23:41:26.210Z","harness:codex","Exact-head review evidence: flag-invocation-parity is now present in the exhaustive release automation inventory with its seeded arity negative control, and the inventory discovers its independently named executable. The committed registry, parity corpus, repository static gate, and exact full coverage all pass."
  "2026-08-19T01:01:52.369Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence 2026-08-19: review amendments make every current closed-domain get/search/list/context/next recovery preserve real positional operands through suggested_retry_args, use shell-safe display rendering, retain redaction through structured normalization, and require usage exit code. The executable corpus expanded from 4 to 8 probes and executes whitespace-bearing search retries without reparsing display text. Clean-room manual acceptance executed 6 CLI refusals/retries plus SDK get/search refusals and successful calls in an isolated tracker, then removed it. Final repository proof: 529/529 files and 7,586/7,586 tests pass; exact coverage is 55,439/55,439 statements, 41,357/41,357 branches, 11,473/11,473 functions, and 53,497/53,497 lines. quality:static passes including recovery closure 8/8, SDK surface governance, graph composition, and record integrity. Remaining feature acceptance is the generated exhaustive corpus, all error-code reachability, and historical ratchet, so this item will return open."
  "2026-08-19T04:10:06.315Z","harness:codex","Implementation start 2026-08-19: replace the eight-row hand-maintained refusal gate with contract-generated probes, persisted ratchet data, required-argument/mutual-exclusion/domain coverage, and declared error-code reachability. This item is actively edited in the combined recovery-contract PR."
  "2026-08-19T05:28:37.686Z","harness:codex","Broad tranche evidence 2026-08-19: the hand-maintained refusal sample is replaced by an SDK-generated 18-contract corpus with a persisted historical minimum and required-probe ratchet. Scoring now verifies refusal exit, stable error code, complete allowed domain when required, shell-free retry argv, exact SDK-owned retry arguments, and actual retry success; seeded omission, malformed recovery, corpus regression, invalid JSON, and empty-corpus negative controls fail. Gate runtime tests retain one real end-to-end corpus execution and use focused injected negative controls instead of replaying the full CLI four times. Full 7,597-test exact coverage and quality:static pass. Honest residual: this tranche covers all core context-intent and read-projection closed domains plus their mutual exclusions, but the item's broader acceptance still asks for every closed-domain flag, every required-argument omission, every mutual-exclusion pair, and every declared repository error code; keep it open after delivery."
  "2026-08-19T05:47:18.405Z","harness:codex","Final tranche evidence 2026-08-19: the generated 18-probe closed-domain corpus executes real refusals and retries, requires exact error code/domain/retry arguments, fails omissions, and ratchets historical probe identities. Packed acceptance proves the public unknown_field_projection recovery envelope. Full 7,598-test exact 100/100/100/100 coverage and static assurance pass. Honest residual remains the item-wide census of every declared error code and every constrained flag family, so this feature must stay open after delivery."
  "2026-08-19T06:28:57.014Z","harness:codex","Final local pre-PR evidence 2026-08-19: the combined refusal closure implementation passes all 530 files and 7,598 tests at exact 100/100/100/100, the complete repository static assurance stack, ESLint, zero-clone detection, secret scanning, audit, and packed npm/npx/Bun/bunx acceptance. This feature remains actively claimed through hosted review because exhaustive every-code/every-domain refusal closure remains broader than this 18-probe tranche."
