  "2026-08-21T22:48:10.211Z","harness:codex","Implementation start 2026-08-22: one coupled SDK/CLI/contract/assurance tranche will declare binding diagnostic ceilings, preserve corrective actions through deterministic degradation, replay the ten most frequent refusal paths in isolated trackers, and extend executable recovery evidence. Only these four actively edited items are claimed; all other backlog items remain unclaimed."
  "2026-08-21T23:58:53.188Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence (2026-08-22): extended executable recovery closure with action-first diagnostic projection, required-action preservation, deterministic degradation receipts, a 10-probe governed diagnostic corpus, and negative controls for missing corrective action and invalid receipts. Refusal closure passed 22/22 and diagnostic output passed 10/10; diagnostic corpus measured 5,709 estimated tokens and no findings. Full lint/static assurance, 7,717-test exact 100% coverage, security scan/audit, packed npx, and isolated Node/bunx validation passed. Item remains active because its acceptance criteria require exhaustive runtime coverage of every remaining documented domain/error code."
